%rec: object
# What the game shows and plays for a D1 object, by its OBJ_ id. name is the display name
# (icons.rec has none); light is the radius of the ones that glow (ProcessObjects' Obj_Light);
# container marks the ones that are looted, which may give nothing; wall_light marks the
# decorative lights D1 places directly; sfx is the sound it makes as it is used.
# Objects with no row here are decoration the game never names.

